From: Dana Whitfield <dana.whitfield@hangs-cs.example>
To: Tax preparation <tax@finance-demo.example>
Subject: HANGS Construction Services 2025 Form 1120 (FY2026) year-end records
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:20:00 -0700
Message-ID: <HCS-FY2026-1120@hangs-cs.example>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="=_HCS_FY2026_1120_records"

--=_HCS_FY2026_1120_records
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi,

Attached are the audited trial balance at June 30, 2026, the ledger detail yo=
u asked for and the equipment register with book and tax depreciation. Last y=
ear's return summary, the questionnaire, the tax payment log and the board re=
solution are in the shared folder. Please prepare the 2025 Form 1120 for our =
fiscal year ended June 30, 2026 for us to review. We filed Form 7004 on Septe=
mber 15 with a $15,000.00 payment.

A few things you will want to look at:

- We made no estimated payments during FY2026; the board expected last year's=
 loss to cover the year.
- The depreciation software took 100% bonus on every FY2026 addition.
- The board resolution for officer pay still has to be signed.
- The crane we sold in March went through accumulated depreciation, not a gai=
n account.
- Juniper Ridge paid pay application 1 on July 20.

Thanks,
Dana Whitfield
Controller, HANGS Construction Services LLC

--=_HCS_FY2026_1120_records
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="FY2026 year-end trial balance.xlsx"
MIME-Version: 1.0

